{"id":"491419","name":"猪肉白菜汤","author":"香飘我家厨房","authorId":"8991321","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/491419/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白菜","amount":"一颗"},{"name":"粉皮","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"十三香","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大白菜洗净控水。","img":"images/491419/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"白菜帮切薄片。","img":"images/491419/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"白菜叶和白菜帮分开。","img":"images/491419/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"猪肉切片，葱姜切片。","img":"images/491419/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"炒锅烧热加油放葱姜爆香，放猪肉炒。","img":"images/491419/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"白菜入锅炒出水分。","img":"images/491419/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再加白菜帮炒。","img":"images/491419/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒至白菜很软加适量的水。","img":"images/491419/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"粉皮洗净。","img":"images/491419/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入洗净的粉皮。煮至粉皮很软，停火。","img":"images/491419/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/491419/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}